7:00","id":1084697,"title":"","content":"Imagine entering a plane with every intent to hijack it and the next thing you know, you are alone in a plane that's undergoing maintenance... Imagine trying to make a video about your cause with Arcane 6 or more... Imagine the voice of Achmed,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T14:40:26-07:00","id":1084704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacecat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1083601-batini-and-iran?p=1084332#post1084332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm now thinking politically incorrect thoughts about a group called the Talibatini, a terrorist group with Arcane so high no one remembers their acts of terrorism or attributes these to someone else. Also, sometimes they phase in and out of existence during critical moments. I want to involve Achmed the dead terrorist.</div> </div> </div> </div>Achmed is a Lich, using his undead state and magick to explode himself over and over.<br /> <br /> On another note, one would think that having Arcane 6+ would run counter to the goals of terrorism. That is, to inspire terror. If no one remembered the acts, there'd be no point in com